=\"p-duration\">that is brand-new</span>.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by sorcerers and druids of level 100 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 11.50 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Looks like <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tiara of Power (Red)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tiara_of_Power_Red_cc4d09.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> when equipped. Increases your Mana and Hitpoints Regeneration for 60 minutes (1 hours) by the rate of 2 HP and 8 MP per 6 seconds, which means it will recover 4800 MP and 1200 HP in total. Tiara of Power can't be repaired. It disappears after using for 60 minutes.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Anomaly\">Anomaly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eradicator\">Eradicator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Outburst\">Outburst</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Realityquake\">Realityquake</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rupture\">Rupture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Devourer\">World Devourer</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"cl